#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sale_order_blanket_order_stock_prebook.field_sale_order__blanket_reservation_strategy
msgid "Specifies when the stock should be reserved for the blanket order.  When the strategy is 'At Order Confirmation', the stock is reserved when the blanket order is confirmed. When the strategy is 'At Call-off', the stock is reserved when the call-off order is confirmed."
msgstr "Indica cuándo se reservan las existencias del pedido marco. Con «Al confirmar el pedido» se reservan al confirmar el pedido marco; con «En la liberación» se reservan al confirmar el pedido de liberación."
